{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i></i><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952330/extras/ee85f7f908c0e8d0d783998c65890969.avif?t=1768304804\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952330/extras_big/ee85f7f908c0e8d0d783998c65890969.webp?t=1768304804 width=1560 height=658 /></span><br><i>Inspired by 90's and 2000's 3D platformers, Cosmo Vulpes is a sci-fi adventure where your main tool is the jetpack. Play  as bounty hunter fox called Klaus, with his jetpack and others gadgets developed by his friend Safira, a brilliant and skilled mechanic, you will help him to pass through challenges and missions on this adventure, earning money and collecting Vultechs, which are a big source of energy, but he is not the only one looking for them!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952330/extras/3b29c63445b1b0d07955ffa50f4248b8.avif?t=1768304804\" width=1400 height=250 /></span><i> </i><br><i>Energy is something extremely valuable, a bounty hunter fox called Klaus together with his long time friend Safira <strong>are broke!</strong>\u00a0Now they need explore the galaxy looking for missions and rewards to pay their bills, collecting Energy Gears and the Vultech Crystals, a powerful source of energy! Seems like a company who hires bounty-hunters announced a big reward for the bounty-hunter group who stays at the first of the rank at the end of the season, this is a big opportunity right? Combine Klaus' agility and skills with all the tools provided by the little fox, mainly the jetpack, while she do all the tech work and assistence!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952330/extras/49b587ae232389e673368e50c7606dbd.avif?t=1768304804\" width=1400 height=250 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A jetpack that can make you fly through the levels</strong>!\u00a0<span class=\"bb_strike\">(this one it's obvious at this point)</span><strong>\u00a0</strong>Get through large distances and higher grounds with this item that is almost a extension of Klaus' body!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expressive movement and platforming!</strong> Use your jetpack and gadgets the way you want, chain them, make awesome moves and traverse the levels how you like it!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>5 Rivals to face off!</strong> Being a bounty hunter it's not easy, face this rivals and show that you really need to pay your bills!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stylized characters!</strong> Meet several stylized characters in these colorful worlds, even though not everyone is so friendly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenge levels to test your skill and speed!</strong> How fast can you beat theses levels? And what rank did you get on them? Try your best to get the hidden rank SS!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952330/extras/798f258fbe2b6ab79f793128a7e06226.avif?t=1768304804\" width=1400 height=676 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3952330?t=1768304804","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3952330?t=1768304804","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952330/007bcc817cd51ea757d498d6b23f04724d02af94/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768304804","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.aka