st of the rank at the end of the season, this is a big opportunity right? Combine Klaus' agility and skills with all the tools provided by the little fox, mainly the jetpack, while she do all the tech work and assistence!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952330/extras/49b587ae232389e673368e50c7606dbd.avif?t=1768304804\" width=1400 height=250 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A jetpack that can make you fly through the levels</strong>!\u00a0<span class=\"bb_strike\">(this one it's obvious at this point)</span><strong>\u00a0</strong>Get through large distances and higher grounds with this item that is almost a extension of Klaus' body!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expressive movement and platforming!</strong> Use your jetpack and gadgets the way you want, chain them, make awesome moves and traverse the levels how you like it!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>5 Rivals to face off!</strong> Being a bounty hunter it's not easy, face this rivals and show that you really need to pay your bills!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stylized characters!</strong> Meet several stylized characters in these colorful worlds, even though not everyone is so friendly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenge levels to test your skill and speed!</strong> How fast can you beat theses levels? And what rank did you get on them? Try your best to get the hidden rank SS!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952330/extras/798f258fbe2b6ab79f793128a7e06226.avif?t=1768304804\" width=1400 height=676 /></span></p>","developers":["Eoni"],"genres":[{"description":"Ac